es":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"bloodborn_spawn":{"slug":"bloodborn_spawn","name":"Bloodborn Spawn","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bloodborn Spawn.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A creation of the Sanguine Court's Originium Arts. It is said that just a few drops of fresh blood can spawn an entire swarm of these mindless worms. Once they've latched on, they will never let go until their hunger and thirst have been sated.","abilities":["Deals Arts damage and gains increased ATK depending on the number of units the target is blocking.","Attacks restore HP proportional to damage dealt","Leaves behind <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":100,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"gift_of_magnanimity":{"slug":"gift_of_magnanimity","name":"Gift of Magnanimity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Gift of Magnanimity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A creation of the Sanguinarch of Vampires' Originium Arts that bears exceptional vitality. One who was powerful in life will continue to be a great threat to their enemies even after being reshaped by the power of the Sanguinarch's blessing. Therefore, those who continue ought to thank the Sanguinarch for his magnanimity.","abilities":["Reborn Creation (takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage)","Units blocking it gain +1 Block (up to a maximum of +6)"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":800,"def":200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_fluxcaster_captain","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Fluxcaster Captain.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Sarkaz Caster responsible for guarding the Feranmut's skeleton, their nature warped due to perpetually drifting through spacetime along with it, to the point that their very existence has become tenuous. In times of emergency, they will call upon the Feranmut's power to hide within the turbulent folds of spacetime before reappearing at a more opportune time to deliver a fatal blow.","abilities":["If defeated within range of a Bloodcalling Altar, slips into a turbulence in spacetime and cannot be attacked during this period.","Will revive on the field when affected by an altar's pulse."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":420,"def":300,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_boneguard_torturer":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_torturer","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Torturer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Torturer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An elite armsmaster responsible for protecting the Feranmut's skeleton, carefully selected by the most senior members of the Military Commission. The degree of their fusion with the Feranmut's nerves defies common understanding, with their ancient witchcraft drilled deep into their bodies.","abilities":["Recovers a portion of HP and gains increased ATK when either enemy or friendly units are defeated within range (can stack).","Leaves behind 2 <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1200,"def":1200,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sarkaz_boneguard_captain":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_captain",